    "updated_at": "2022-10-21T01:10:37Z",
    "body": "I don't quite understand. Note that every realm, ever, has a [[HostDefined]] field with an environment settings object. So as long as there *is* a current realm, then step 1 in HostResolveImportedModule will work.\r\n\r\nAre you saying there is no current realm when JavaScript calls HostResolveImportedModule? I don't believe that's correct.",
