    "updated_at": "2022-10-21T16:21:36Z",
    "body": "Ah ok, yes I mean that there's no current realm when HostResolveImportedModule gets called while linking then (or at least I'm not aware of a step pushing an execution context onto the stack for that to be the case).\r\n\r\nThe way I was thinking about this was a bit skewed by our implementation which suffers from architectural shortcomings around the execution context stack. (that shouldn't matter for this issue however)",
