    "updated_at": "2022-10-22T06:10:49Z",
    "body": "OK, I think I see the problem. We should basically invert the flow, and only look up the current settings object when referencingScriptOrModule is null. In those cases, we'll be guaranteed to have a current settings object, because it's happening in response to running event handler code.\r\n\r\nHmm, there are various issues with that algorithm... let me try to do a general cleanup.",
